+title: data-contract-reviewer report, <audit folder>
+author: Claude <model as dispatched> (data-contract-reviewer)
+date: <YYYY-MM-DD>
+status: audit finding, not yet deliberated
+---
+
+## Inputs missing
+- `data` block absent
+- `goal_doc`: none
+
+(With a full config, this section reads `none`.)
+
