+---
+name: gate-auditor
+description: Audits the checks themselves. Does each test, bot, bench and CLI gate fail when it should, run where the project says it runs, and has each check that runs outside the gate passed since the paths it guards last changed. Reads git history and greps; never runs a check. Runs in the full scope, and in any scope except live and ideas whose fence touches tests, QA, check or bench tools, the manifest's scripts block, test runner config or CI definitions.
